*> vybe-test: cobol/class_clause/class_clause_runtime_space_class
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_class_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLS15.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SPECIAL-NAMES.
    CLASS SPACE-CLASS IS SPACE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 CH PIC X VALUE SPACE.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF CH IS SPACE-CLASS
        DISPLAY "SPACE"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "SPACE" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "SPACE"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [SPACE] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.

